# Hooking Kids with Humanities.

**Authors:** Anstead, Neil L.

## Abstract
Humanitas is part of Collaboratives for Humanities and Arts Teaching (CHART), a nationwide network funded primarily by the Rockefeller Foundation. In 11 large school districts and numerous rural districts, high school teachers, academics, artists, and business and community leaders are cooperating to promote teaching of the arts and humanities. The program targets meaningful, often-ignored issues. (MLH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ468699

